# Internationalization

Default locale: **en-US**. Also support **zh-CN**.

## Rules

1. Never hardcode user-visible English or Chinese strings in `crates/`
2. Add keys to `crates/rusql-i18n/locales/en-US.yml` and `zh-CN.yml` with matching helpers in `rusql_i18n::messages`
3. Call `rusql_i18n::messages::*()` from other crates (do not use `t!` outside `rusql-i18n`)
4. Doc comments and internal logs may be English; protocol/SQL errors shown to clients must be i18n

## Locale Selection

- Environment: `RUSQL_LOCALE=en-US` or `zh-CN`
- CLI: `--locale zh-CN`
- Call `rusql_i18n::init()` at process startup
